I have just been changing Lavagnino's endnotes.sty so that \label
and \ref work properly in endnotes, and I noticed that in latex.tex,
around line 2661 of the 14 Jan 1991 version, there is the statement
that footnote counters are not referencable.  But they are, of course,
and LL has worked quite hard with the \@currentlabel definition
to make sure they are.

Dominik




